      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What happens to ag-valued land in Kendall County if I develop it?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Changing the use of land under 1-d-1 open-space appraisal triggers a three-year rollback tax equal to the difference between taxes paid on agricultural value and taxes that would have been paid on market value. A CPA should model that liability before you buy ag-valued land for development."
      }
    }
  ]
}

{
