      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Why is Kendall County growing so fast?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Most of the growth is domestic migration, meaning households relocating from elsewhere in the United States rather than natural increase. In-migration adds a household immediately, often with equity from a prior sale, which is the fastest-acting form of housing demand."
